    $( Define the _center_ of a magma, which is the elements that commute with
       all others.  (Contributed by Stefan O'Rear, 5-Sep-2015.) $)
    df-cntr $a |- Cntr = ( m e. _V |-> ( ( Cntz ` m ) ` ( Base ` m ) ) ) $.
