    $( Define the left projection function, which takes two subgroups ` t , u `
       with trivial intersection and returns a function mapping the elements of
       the subgroup sum ` t + u ` to their projections onto ` t ` .  (The other
       projection function can be obtained by swapping the roles of ` t ` and
       ` u ` .)  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 15-Oct-2015.) $)
