       Carneiro, 21-Dec-2014.) $)
    mgpval $p |- M = ( R sSet <. ( +g ` ndx ) , .x. >. ) $=
      ( vr cmgp cfv cnx cplusg cop csts co cvv wcel wceq cv cmulr id fveq2 ovex
