       (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 2-Dec-2014.) $)
    isdrng $p |- ( R e. DivRing <-> ( R e. Ring /\ U = ( B \ { .0. } ) ) ) $=
      ( vr cv cui cfv cbs c0g csn cdif wceq crg cdr fveq2 eqtr4di sneqd eqeq12d
      difeq12d df-drng elrab2 ) HIZJKZUFLKZUFMKZNZOZPCADNZOZPHBQRUFBPZUGCUKUMUN
      UGBJKCUFBJSFTUNUHAUJULUNUHBLKAUFBLSETUNUIDUNUIBMKDUFBMSGTUAUCUBHUDUE $.

