      VEUPVAAISVKVCVHHVAAVBJUATUBVGVIDUPAIUIUCUDUEVIUSDBUPVBBQVHURHVBBAJUFTUJUG
      UHUOUQUSUKUL $.
  $}

  $( Reverse closure for a sub-division-ring predicate.  (Contributed by SN,
     19-Feb-2025.) $)
  sdrgrcl $p |- ( A e. ( SubDRing ` R ) -> R e. DivRing ) $=
    ( csdrg cfv wcel cdr csubrg cress co issdrg simp1bi ) ABCDEBFEABGDEBAHIFEBA
    JK $.

  ${
    sdrgdrng.1 $e |- S = ( R |`s A ) $.
