      AAVJVBSWBABTVJWBBVRTFCQVAVCVDVEVFVG $.

    $( The functionalization of the involution component of a structure.
       (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 6-Oct-2015.) $)
    stafval $p |- ( A e. B -> ( .xb ` A ) = ( .* ` A ) ) $=
      ( vx cv cfv fveq2 staffval fvex fvmpt ) IAIJZEKAEKBDPAELIBCDEFGHMAENO $.

    $( The functionalization is equal to the original function, if it is a
       function on the right base set.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
       6-Oct-2015.) $)
    staffn $p |- ( .* Fn B -> .xb = .* ) $=
      ( vx wfn cv cfv cmpt staffval wceq dffn5 biimpi eqtr4id ) DAIZCHAHJDKLZDH
      ABCDEFGMRDSNHADOPQ $.
