      USIAUAUBVCUSIAUCZVEUOCAKUQCNZVFVBACDEFUEUQCUFUSVGICAURCUQUGUHUIUSIAUJUKUT
      ADFULUMUN $.

    $( The span of a set of vectors (in a left module).  ( ~ spanval analog.)
