    $d x Z $.
    $( A pre-Hilbert space is a left vector space.  (Contributed by Mario
       Carneiro, 7-Oct-2015.) $)
    phllvec $p |- ( W e. PreHil -> W e. LVec ) $=
      ( vy vx cphl wcel clvec csca cfv csr cbs cv cip co cmpt crglmod clmhm c0g
      wceq wral eqid wi cstv w3a isphl simp1bi ) ADEAFEAGHZIEBAJHZBKZCKZALHZMZN
      AUFOHPMEUIUIUJMUFQHZRUIAQHZRUAUIUHUJMUFUBHZHUKRBUGSUCCUGSCBUFUJUNUGAUMULU
