       of ~ df-pj1 , but we restrict the domain of this function to only total
       projection functions.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 16-Oct-2015.) $)
    df-pj $a |- proj = ( h e. _V |-> ( ( x e. ( LSubSp ` h ) |->
      ( x ( proj1 ` h ) ( ( ocv ` h ) ` x ) ) ) i^i
